backups/

# Third-party agent skills installed via `npx skills add`. The packages and
# versions are recorded in skills-lock.json (committed), so they are restored
# with `npx skills experimental_install` rather than vendored into this repo.
# .claude/skills/graphify is a first-party project skill and stays tracked.
.agents/
.claude/skills/headroom/
.claude/skills/supabase/
.claude/skills/supabase-postgres-best-practices/

